    {
      "id": "calculus-2-5:improper-total",
      "type": "numeric",
      "prompt": "A gel releases a factor at r(t) = 2.0 e^(−0.1t) μg/h. What total amount is released over all time, ∫₀^∞ r(t) dt? Enter a value and unit.",
